    "result_text": "The change is complete and the full test suite is green.\n\n## What I did\n\nThe `GET /api/owners/{id}` response is an `OwnerDto` generated from `openapi.yml` and populated by MapStruct's `OwnerMapper`. I added the `initials` field in two places to mirror how the existing `displayName` field is handled:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added an `initials` property (read-only string) to the `Owner` schema so the generated `OwnerDto` carries the field.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a `@Mapping` expression that computes it:\n   ```java\n   Character.toUpperCase(firstName.charAt(0)) + \".\" + Character.toUpperCase(lastName.charAt(0)) + \".\"\n   ```\n   For `firstName=\"john\"`, `lastName=\"smith\"` this yields `\"J.S.\"`.\n\n## Result\n\n- `AcceptanceTest.coreComputesInitials` passes (asserts `$.initials == \"J.S.\"`).\n- Full suite: **BUILD SUCCESS**, `Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0`.",
